# Everything the tests generate inside the fixture project.
#
# `build/strays/` holds the stray files stray_test writes, and `harness/`
# holds the copies stray.check elaborates — it exists because `check` puts
# them under `<repo_root>/harness/build/strays/` and a fixture run's
# repo_root is this directory. Both are outputs of a test run, and four of
# them were committed once before this file existed.
/build/
/harness/
/.lake/
